<description>&lt;p&gt;IS-linked militants attacked an Ebola clinic in eastern DR Congo, forcing patients to flee and killing dozens of civilians, while ADF fighters assaulted villages in North Kivu, killing 33 residents. The United Nations peacekeeping mission is set to leave the country in December, and the United States has sanctioned Rwanda’s defence ministry and its military bank Zigama. Joseph Kabila now heads a rebel coalition that includes M23, which has taken positions in Rugezi after a week of fighting with government troops. 1,158 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/06/world/europe/europe-migrants-rwanda.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxOY3hDQ29FQUxyUUVZV2RBUUFUX0RoUDhEUE40Y3p1VTZ0RTdNakF1QU9OOXkxaWQ1VUdRM09ETVdvaUgxeE1qTXJqSDkzUElaNW1NTmZDUFZ1TGw0bmhud3hDbjBpdjVLRVFLYTdSSHMtZ0tqNDhyRzZMM3FFdUdab21qLWNQek0?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBrckd2V1JMLWpNY2NBd0ZjaV9PRTlvU2JvM3ZrNUZqTDB1cXhKM2EwZWVKN2E2eElEdGRtSWxFTk9fZzRYVE1zSW5JdjdPVWdaTURWMjVXQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxOUjdvMzhsUExDa2lhS3Z4VmpOVlhEWldzTUN2SFhBZFpfVXEtZ0RnNW9mRGFfTnVMTnhKUEdGMGpSR1MyS3lGTTBINE92Zkl0S1AtSHdFaUFIQVZNTXczZW05LWtaUm5CUkZCRTFLbTF2WGZhbDRNYy1uOERxekdIOC1RSDBodVBDdlRIdnlubHN3d0pzMC1WbmU4MHV1aXF3Nm8tX1NCMUUtaUluNnRQUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxOTDAxdEUwdDVLVVpWZXVjNFZmS20tNVlKRFBxM1dsbzRuS21NRHVYOHItb3F1Z240MWVHR0o5SnNFZVBRbkpOUFRMVkxyX3NHUVRIWWRod0txUlh4b05xVWpTV242eGIxTDlqak1fSEF6V3owem